        "original_id": "9529f1b7-54d4-5b25-b26b-8be41c4c27bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Big Pig, Blur\n- People: Sherine Abeyratne, Damon Albarn, Graham Coxon, Alex James, Dave Rowntree, Tony Antonaides, Neil Baker, Nick Disbray, Tim Rosewarne, Adrian Scaglione, Oleh Witer\n- Roles: lead vocals, percussion, vocals, harmonica, drums, keyboards, guitar, bass\n\nFacts:\n- Big Pig was an Australian funk, rock, and pop band that existed from 1985 to 1991.\n- From 1985 to 1991, Sherine Abeyratne provided lead vocals for Big Pig.\n- An early Big Pig line-up included Sherine on lead vocals and percussion, Tony Antonaides on vocals and harmonica, Neil Baker on drums, Nick Disbray on vocals and percussion, Tim Rosewarne on vocals and keyboards, Adrian Scaglione on drums, and Oleh Witer on vocals and percussion.\n- Tim Rosewarne and Oleh Witer were ex-Bang members before joining the early Big Pig line-up, and Sherine had been in Editions and Bang before Big Pig.\n- Blur consists of Damon Albarn as singer and keyboardist, Graham Coxon as guitarist and singer, Alex James as bassist, and Dave Rowntree as drummer.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "4ec55824-09d7-50f2-89fc-074162c169ed",
        "text": "Page: Big Pig. Sentence: Big Pig were an Australian funk, rock and pop band that existed from 1985 to 1991.\nPage: Big Pig. Sentence: An early line-up was Sherine on lead vocals and percussion (ex-Editions, Bang); Tony Antonaides on vocals and harmonica; Neil Baker on drums; Nick Disbray on vocals and percussion; Tim Rosewarne on vocals and keyboards (ex-Bang); Adrian Scaglione on drums; and Oleh Witer on vocals and percussion (ex-Bang).\nPage: Blur (band). Sentence: The group consists of singer/keyboardist Damon Albarn, guitarist/singer Graham Coxon, bassist Alex James and drummer Dave Rowntree.\nPage: Sherine Abeyratne. Sentence: They also pursued their own separate careers; for example, Sherine provided lead vocals for Big Pig from 1985 to 1991.",
